From: Charles Fussell & Co <litigation@charlesfussell.example> (Solicitors for Genesis Mining Iceland)
To: Digital Capital Ltd <d.arlov@digital-capital.example> (Digital Capital)
Date: 2019-06-03
Subject: Pre-Action Protocol Letter of Claim - Genesis Wallet Service Agreement

Our client Genesis Mining Iceland ehf says that Digital Capital has substantially failed to provide the services contracted for under the Agreement, and that our client has not been provided with evidence of any work undertaken/benefits rendered by Digital Capital under the Agreement. We are concerned that sums paid to Digital Capital by our client have been misapplied, and there has been a total failure of consideration.

Digital Capital has thereby committed material breaches of the Agreement which are incapable of remedy and which entitle our client to terminate the Agreement immediately. Alternatively, Digital Capital is in repudiatory breach, which our client accepts.

